WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.992
A drug is tested against a sugar

2
00:00:02.992 --> 00:00:06.050
pill. A strategy can be too.

3
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:09.042
Slide carry's real positions to 500 random

4
00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:12.869
dates. Each bar counts copies with that score.

5
00:00:13.169 --> 00:00:15.862
95% of the copies score below 0.41.

6
00:00:15.862 --> 00:00:18.150
That is the bar.

7
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.142
Carry on its real dates scores 0.39,

8
00:00:21.142 --> 00:00:23.431
just under the bar.

9
00:00:23.731 --> 00:00:26.423
32 of the 500 copies did at

10
00:00:26.423 --> 00:00:28.327
least as well.

11
00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:29.781
That is 6%.

12
00:00:29.781 --> 00:00:31.704
The bar is under 5%,

13
00:00:31.704 --> 00:00:36.162
so carry fails the placebo test.
